SUMMARY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Native SwiftUI parity of the "Helix natural-language SQL drafter" AI surface, built
from the AINLDriveSearch template (same useAiStream + AIFeatureCard + withAiFeature
primitives) plus the SQL-playground-specific captured-draft + propose-only
"Apply to editor" flow (web `parseReadonlySQLDraft` / `onApply`).

Files shipped (11): AINLSqlPlayground.{Adapter,Logic,Model,Source,Views,Chrome}.swift,
AINLSqlPlayground.swift, AINLSqlPlayground.Previews.swift, AINLSqlPlayground.strings,
AINLSqlPlayground.Tests.swift, AINLSqlPlayground.ModelTests.swift.

States reproduced (all render; none hidden): gateLoading (skeleton), ready/idle invite,
streaming (Helix thinking), rationale (delta accumulation), draft-ready (captured
ReadonlySQLDraft -> SQL preview + table chips + "Apply to editor"), stream error,
gateError (QueryError peer + retry), stale (+auto-refresh) / offline (cached + disabled),
gatedOff (renders nothing = web withAiFeature -> null).

Data binding: NLSqlPlaygroundModel (P1/S8 state-holder seam); no HTTP in the view.
i18n: P1/S10 facade (NLSqlPlaygroundStrings), table "AINLSqlPlayground"; 8 source keys +
shared Helix scaffold keys + native chrome keys; no English literals in Swift.
Telemetry: view.opened with slug "AINLSqlPlayground" (P1/S11).

